## Hints

- E3: centered cosine = Pearson correlation exactly. If any pair disagrees,
  check your centering.
- E5: 0.98 correlation ≈ 11.5° angle, not 0° — the difference vector has
  small but nonzero norm, and at 2× leverage "small" can be your margin call.
